- **Parameterized Queries**: Always use parameterized queries to prevent SQL injection. For example, use `db.get('SELECT id FROM invitations WHERE email = ?', [email], ...)` instead of concatenating user input directly into SQL statements.
- other security issues when the code touches predefined risk categories (e.g. input, storage, File, auth, memory, crypto).

